.TH IMCURVIN 1 "August 2026" "1.3.0" "imcurvin manual"
.SH NAME
imcurvin \- Advanced multi-vector vulnerability exploitation and perimeter reconnaissance framework
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B imcurvin
\-u <TARGET_URL> [OPTION]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B imcurvin
is an open-source web security auditing and MySQL injection POC framework featuring synchronized dual-vector parallel processing and high-concurrency layer bypass matrices.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-u, \-\-url <URL>
Specify the target website URL (Required).
.TP
.B \-tech, \-\-technique
Display advanced technical methodologies and framework configurations.
.TP
.B \-rec, \-\-recon
Run environment reconnaissance.
.TP
.B \-shwpld, \-\-show-payload
Show payloads actively during execution.
.TP
.B \-val, \-\-validate
Enable post-scan Python validation engine for latency isolation.
.TP
.B \-cookie=<string>
Ingest custom session cookies (e.g., \-cookie="PHPSESSID=123").
.TP
.B \-valnow, \-\-validate-now
Validate the log file now.
.TP
.B \-skip
Skipping "Testing connection to target url" (TESTING).
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display this help guide.
.SH FUN FACTS!
.IP "Fun Fact:"
Community testing has proven that the automated multi-port TOR routing within this framework remains highly resilient and extremely stable even under heavy concurrent traffic loads.
